{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10393","headline":"同观陈十六史兴碑 · 高适","name":"同观陈十六史兴碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆衡气偏秀，江汉流不歇。\n此地多精灵，有时生才杰。\n伊人今独步，逸思能间发。\n永怀掩风骚，千载常矻矻。\n新碑亦崔嵬，佳句悬日月。\n则是刊石经，终然继檮杌。\n我来观雅制，慷慨变毛发。\n季主尽荒淫，前王徒贻厥。\n东周既削弱，两汉更沦没。\n西晋何披猖，五胡相唐突。\n作歌乃彰善，比物仍恶讦。\n感叹将谓谁，对之空咄咄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}